        "text": "Technical requirements\nThe following are the technical requirements for this chapter:\n\u2022I You need to have Python 3.7 or later installed on your computer.\n\u2022I Python Flask library with RESTful extensions installed on top of a Python 3.7 or\nlater release.\n\u2022I Python Django with Django Rest Framework library on top of a Python 3.7 or later\nrelease.\n\u2022I You need to have a Docker registry account and installed Docker Engine and\nDocker Compose on your machine.\n\u2022I To deploy a microservice in GCP Cloud Run, you will need a GCP account (a free\ntrial will work fine).\nSample code for this chapter can be found at https://github.com/\nPacktPublishing/Python-for-Geeks/tree/master/Chapter11 .\nWe will start our discussion with the introduction of microservices.",
